xture-packs/mizunos-x-reinforced-chest-barrels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno x 強化儲物箱與桶</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p><strong>其他作品：</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fShorkBee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/130037dd8c972d8573f49d7928b542711e2f6ed4.png\" alt=\"連結至 ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shorkbee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c450b18c2c965d2e2a798f1576231a1f1f37458e_0.webp\" alt=\"連結至 ShorkBee\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\"></a></p>",
